[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 18063.03, "timestamp": "05:01:03", "text": "16. 已经过了一个小时了，我仍然很吃力。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18066.27, "timestamp": "05:01:06", "text": "我还在第一阶段。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18068.788, "timestamp": "05:01:08", "text": "课。好吧，我们不打算解释。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18071.868, "timestamp": "05:01:11", "text": "我要速通这个游戏。好吧，我真是太"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18074.868, "timestamp": "05:01:14", "text": "对不起。啊，兄弟。好的，等等。我们开始吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18078.23, "timestamp": "05:01:18", "text": "这。嗯，第十名，对吧？好的。我这就去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18081.11, "timestamp": "05:01:21", "text": "不，呃，解释一下。我只会听，然后照做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18102.51, "timestamp": "05:01:42", "text": "呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18113.788, "timestamp": "05:01:53", "text": "玛西。"}]